WEBVTT

00:37:28.246 --> 00:37:31.913
I mean, yeah, and getting feedback
from people. Right.

00:37:32.163 --> 00:37:35.954
And not just sitting in my solitude. I
mean, that's the thing about that.

00:37:35.954 --> 00:37:39.496
That kind of deep solitude is
it's just like it's just you

00:37:40.329 --> 00:37:43.621
and there's nothing to do but
reckon with yourself.

00:37:43.746 --> 00:37:47.163
There's nothing to do but have that
conversation with yourself in your head.

00:37:47.829 --> 00:37:51.788
There's nothing to do but allow
those memories to emerge.

00:37:51.996 --> 00:37:54.038
By the time I was finished with my hike,

00:37:54.246 --> 00:37:59.204
I honestly felt like I had
thought about everything

00:37:59.204 --> 00:38:02.746
I remembered in my whole life, every
relationship, every person.